OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fdissipate, for a largely dry night
OL,7,Fwith clear spells, more so further
OL,8,Fwest. Feeling chilly, with a touch of
OL,9,Ffrost in places and fog patches
OL,10,Fdeveloping under light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FRemaining dry with sunny
OL,13,Fspells further north, cloudier further
OL,14,Fsouth with chance for a few light
OL,15,Fshowers. Around average temperatures
OL,16,Ffor the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
