OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells inbetween variable cloud with a
OL,7,Ffew scattered showers, these remaining
OL,8,Flight. Temperatures dipping below
OL,9,Faverage by night with some isolated
OL,10,Ffrost and patches of fog developing.
